1579:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_mmuart/mss_uart.c ****  * Interrupt service routine triggered by any MSS UART interrupt. This routine
1580:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_mmuart/mss_uart.c ****  * will call the handler function appropriate to the interrupt from the
1581:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_mmuart/mss_uart.c ****  * handlers previously registered with the driver through calls to the
1582:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_mmuart/mss_uart.c ****  * MSS_UART_set_*_handler() functions, or it will call the default_tx_handler()
1583:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_mmuart/mss_uart.c ****  * function in response to transmit interrupts if MSS_UART_irq_tx() is used to
1584:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_mmuart/mss_uart.c ****  * transmit data.
